<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Dewa Agung Istri Kanya</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 1868</span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Dewa Agung Istri Kanya was a queen of Klungkung, the senior kingdom of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bali">Bali</a>, in the mid-19th century. During the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dutch">Dutch</a> expedition of 1849 she led the resistance at Kusamba, where the Dutch commander General Andreas Michiels was mortally wounded in a night attack. She remained a leading figure at the Klungkung court until her death in 1868.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/dewa-agung-istri-kanya.jpg" alt="Dewa Agung Istri Kanya" width="320" height="213" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Ricordisamoa · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Old_Flag_of_Bali.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
